{
  "//": [
    "Wardens, and the defences raised against them.",
    "",
    "Wardens are sleek lens-eyed chrome custodians -- geometric, never organic.",
    "They are menacing the way a guard dog guarding an empty house is menacing.",
    "Chrome (galvanized, steel_light) is RESERVED as the Warden faction colour",
    "and appears on nothing the player builds, except the Breaker's captured jaw.",
    "Alert-red eyes fade to hologram cyan after the Ignition, so one palette swap",
    "turns the whole faction friendly at the moment of victory.",
    "",
    "One mesh family across all three tiers: Scarab, Lancer and Goliath differ by",
    "scale and palette row only. Legs and mandibles are separate ANIM_ children so",
    "the wiggle shader has something to weight.",
    "",
    "Defences are angular and low -- 45 degree chamfers, wedge profiles, and the",
    "barrel as the longest line on the model.",
    "",
    "Ported from modelgen/gen_warden.py. Blender was Z-up and this is Y-up."
  ],

